* AQUILA engineering substitute, NOT a TI transistor-level or validated model.
* A current-feedback architecture is used, NOT a generic voltage-feedback op amp.
* Pin order: +IN -IN V+ V- OUT REF. See README for SOIC-8 mapping.
* Assumptions at +/-5 V: Zt(0)=355 kohm, Rin-=4 ohm, Cin+=2 pF,
* Cz=1.15 pF (~170 MHz closed-loop with RF~800 ohm, gain +2),
* SR=750 V/us, conservative +/-80 mA limit, 1.5 V rail headroom.
* The 120 mA headline is NOT treated as guaranteed linear output current.
* Iq=1.7 mA/channel; signal rail-current sources are class-B accounting proxies.
* Missing: noise, offset/bias, nonlinear HD, temperature, secondary poles,
* package/PCB parasitics, realistic recovery and rail-dependent performance.
.subckt OPA2684_EQ INP INM VP VN OUT REF
Rplus INP REF 50k
Cplus INP REF 2p
Einput ibuf REF INP REF 1
Rminus INM sense 4
Vsense sense ibuf 0
Btrans REF z I={limit(-I(Vsense),-862.5u,862.5u)}
Rtrans z REF 355k
Ctrans z REF 1.15p
Bclamp target REF V={limit(V(z,REF),V(VN,REF)+1.5,V(VP,REF)-1.5)}
Boutput REF preout I={limit(V(target,OUT),-80m,80m)}
Vout_sense preout OUT 0
Rleak OUT REF 1G
Cout OUT REF 2p
Iq VP VN 1.7m
Bpositive VP REF I={max(I(Vout_sense),0)}
Bnegative REF VN I={max(-I(Vout_sense),0)}
.ends OPA2684_EQ
.subckt OPA2684_DUAL OUTA INA_M INA_P VN INB_P INB_M OUTB VP
XA INA_P INA_M VP VN OUTA 0 OPA2684_EQ
XB INB_P INB_M VP VN OUTB 0 OPA2684_EQ
.ends OPA2684_DUAL
